The field is not a jungle; it was cultivated; sugarcane crop was grown; it was privately owned;
and the village was inhabited, hence, it is unbelievable that no one noticed the foul smell,
particularly when the entire area was combed over for nearly 5-6 days.

J. (VIKRAM NATH) J. (SANJAY KAROL) J.
(SANDEEP MEHTA) New Delhi;
Sanjay vs Union Of India on 6 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/198080665/
